# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern
README.md
.github/assets/logo.png

# Hand-written agent workflows-as-code builder (docs/agents-as-code/workflow-spec.md in
# elevenlabs-js): a layer on top of the generated client that the generator does not emit. It
# builds the generated types.AgentWorkflowRequestModel and passes the shared cross-SDK fixtures
# (vendored in agentworkflows/testdata/fixtures).
agentworkflows/

# Hand-written canonical JSON writer (sorted keys, JavaScript number and string formatting) shared
# by the agents-as-code builders. It sits in the module's internal/ tree so the workflow builder
# and a later tools builder can import it without making it public API.
internal/wirejson/

# Hand-written webhook signature verifier. Fern's built-in verifier can't parse the compound
# `ElevenLabs-Signature: t=...,v0=...` header, so this matches the Python/Rust/.NET SDKs by hand.
# It adds the package-level `webhooks.ConstructEvent` and a `ConstructEvent` method on the
# generated `webhooks.Client` (Go lets a package's methods live in any of its files), so no
# generated file is edited.
webhooks/verifier.go
webhooks/verifier_test.go
